dotengine/godot/pull/108592.patch","merged_at":"2025-07-14T15:34:55Z"},"body":"Currently, when `clip_tabs` is enabled, `TabContainer` and `TabBar`'s minimum sizes are set to 0, resulting in incorrect drawing:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"204\" height=\"104\" alt=\"Incorrect Minimum Size\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/318d6bda-09f7-4ba5-93ca-1fc3292e918a\" />\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes this by including the proper calculation for the width of the `TabBar` when `clip_tabs` is enabled, which means that the minimum width is the width of the current tab plus the arrow icons. It also includes a style change to clarify in `TabContainer::get_minimum_size()` that it is working with widths and heights, to bring it more in line with `TabBar::get_minimum_size()`","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108592/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108592/timeline","performed_via_github_app